This package vendors a modified copy of ds-bot and depends on the published
dsh-codex-ui package. Both are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ds-bot (vendored, modified)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Original project : https://github.com/Fei2411/DeepSeek-Bot
  License          : Apache License, Version 2.0
  Copyright        : 2026 Fei2411 and the DS Bot contributors
  Location in this repo : ds-bot/

  Modifications made in this repository (see the git log for full detail):

    - Composer: restored the shell's official column structure; removed the
      horizontal-band override and the row-dissolving rule that broke the
      layout when a second UI plugin was installed.
    - Sidebar footer: made the footer a single flex row with a locked height,
      so the mode tabs and the account entry share one line.
    - Account entry: reduced to a single icon; the name label is hidden (the
      name remains available in the menu the button opens).
    - Mode switching: replaced the one-way return pill with a two-tab switcher
      (Agent / DS Bot) that works in both surfaces.
    - Plugin panel: moved "Connect plugins" into the account menu; retired the
      footer button and its standing warning badge.
    - Conversation width: removed the local pin of --dsh-chat-content-width so
      the shell's own value applies (the pin made the Bot surface wider than
      the classic Agent surface).

  The full list of changes is in ds-bot/src/client/ and can be reviewed with
  git diff against the upstream tag.

